      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im having crazy bad leg cramps at night and i also cant sleep well lately. i heard magnesium helps with both. i was thinking of taking like 600mg or 800mg of magnesium citrate every night before bed to really knock it out. does that sound okay or is that too much?",
